    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d934">

                <pb facs="1003" n="991" sameAs="frus:frus1945v04/pg991"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00019 Control (Italy)/12–2245</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The President of the Italian Council of Ministers</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">De Gasperi</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Chief Commissioner, Allied Commission</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Stone</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rome</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-12-10">10 December,
                        1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Without the prior consent of the Allied Governments the Royal Italian Government
                    undertakes not to re-open the institutional question until such time as Italy
                    has been liberated and the Italian people have the opportunity of themselves
                    determining the form of Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">De Gasperi Alcide</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
